node_modules/
# The version-probe host fixtures deliberately contain node_modules trees that
# Node resolution must see. Without this exception a clean clone has no fixture
# manifests and the probe walks up into the repository's real dependencies, so
# tests/host only passed on trees where those files happened to exist locally.
!tests/host/fixtures/**/node_modules/
lib/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.tgz
.playwright-cli/
.playwright-mcp/
.dsh-code-index/
coverage/
.DS_Store
*.log
